<title>USA: Healthsource says class action suit withdrawn.</title>
<headline>Healthsource says class action suit withdrawn.</headline>
<dateline>HOOSKET, N.H. 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Healthsource Inc said Thursday a class action suit filed on March 7 against it and others in Merrimack County was withdrawn with prejudice on March 27.</p>
<p>The company said the suit was instituted by shareholders seeking a higher price for their stock. CIGNA Corp, which wants to buy Healthsource, has offered its shareholders $21.75 per share, cash, for all outstanding shares.</p>
<p>The company said it always believed the lawsuit to be without merit and the voluntary action by the plaintiff supports that belief.</p>
<p>Healthsource owns HMOs operating primarily in the Northeast United States.</p>
